            "x_netsecio_sigma_rule": "title: Quick Assist File Creation\nid: 9c7d8e1f-a2b3-4c5d-8e9f-0a1b2c3d4e5f\nstatus: experimental\ndescription: Detects the creation of the Quick Assist executable, which can be abused by threat actors for remote access.\nreferences:\n  - https://threatlabz.zscaler.com/blogs/security-research/ransomware-leverage-growing-terabyte-takeaways-threatlabz-2026-ransomware\nauthor: cyber.netsecops.io\ndate: 2026-10-02\ntags:\n  - attack.t1219\nlevel: low\nlogsource:\n  category: file_event\n  product: windows\ndetection:\n  selection:\n    TargetFilename|endswith: '\\quickassist.exe'\n  condition: selection\nfalsepositives:\n  - Legitimate installation or update of Quick Assist."
        },
